{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"shield_wood","model_identifier":"shield_wood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## shield_wood\n\nShield, wood and leather only (no metal).\n\n- Cubes: 9 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.5..1.0, y -11.0..11.0, z -11.0..11.0 (size 2.5 x 22.0 x 22.0 u = 7 x 62 x 62 cm).\nBasic round shield, about 62 cm (22 u): upright planks on a stepped disc, rawhide edging painted round the rim, two leather lacing bands across the face, a leather grip pad in the centre and a leather-wrapped grip behind. Origin = **slot_shield_l**, outer face -X. No tier variants: there is no metal on it.\n"},"description":"## shield_wood\n\nShield, wood and leather only (no metal).\n\n- Cubes: 9 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.5..1.0, y -11.0..11.0, z -11.0..11.0 (size 2.5 x 22.0 x 22.0 u = 7 x 62 x 62 cm).\nBasic round shield, about 62 cm (22 u): upright planks on a stepped disc, rawhide edging painted round the rim, two leather lacing bands across the face, a leather grip pad in the centre and a leather-wrapped grip behind. Origin = **slot_shield_l**, outer face -X. No tier variants: there is no metal on it.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"board_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1,-11,-4],"to":[0,-9,4],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,29,9,31],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,26,28,28],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[9,29,10,31],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[28,26,36,28],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[56,0,57,8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[57,0,58,8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2ea4acf3-76a5-5898-9ea9-6501f1772aa8"},{"name":"board_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,